div></div></div></div><div class=\"min-w-0\"><div class=\"overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-line\"><table class=\"w-full min-w-[420px] text-sm\"><caption class=\"sr-only\">Current values compared with the scenario</caption><thead class=\"bg-wash text-left text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-muted\"><tr><th scope=\"col\" class=\"px-3 py-2.5 font-semibold\">Metric</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"px-3 py-2.5 text-right font-semibold\">Current</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"px-3 py-2.5 text-right font-semibold\">Scenario</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"px-3 py-2.5 text-right font-semibold\">Change</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-line\"><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"px-3 py-2.5 text-left font-medium\">Payout</th><td class=\"tabular px-3 py-2.5 text-right text-muted\">₹197</td><td class=\"tabular px-3 py-2.5 text-right font-semibold\">₹197</td><td class=\"tabular px-3 py-2.5 text-right font-semibold text-muted\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-minus h-3.5 w-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path></svg>₹0</span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"px-3 py-2.5 text-left font-medium\">Profit per order</th><td class=\"tabular px-3 py-2.5 text-right text-muted\">₹67</td><td class=\"tabular px-3 py-2.5 text-right font-semibold\">₹67</td><td class=\"tabular px-3 py-2.5 text-right font-semibold text-muted\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-minus h-3.5 w-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path></svg>₹0</span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"px-3 py-2.5 text-left font-medium\">Profit %</th><td class=\"tabular px-3 py-2.5 text-right text-muted\">20%</td><td class=\"tabular px-3 py-2.5 text-right font-semibold\">20%</td><td class=\"tabular px-3 py-2.5 text-right font-semibold text-muted\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-minus h-3.5 w-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path></svg>0 pts</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"mt-2 text-xs text-muted-light\">Green means better for your restaurant, red means worse. Estimates only.</p></div></div></section></section><section class=\"print-break rounded-2xl border border-line bg-card p-5 shadow-card sm:p-6\" aria-label=\"Improvement opportunities\"><h2 class=\"text-base font-semibold sm:text-lg\">Improvement opportunities</h2><ul class=\"mt-4 flex flex-col divide-y divide-line\"><li class=\"flex gap-3 py-3 first:pt-0 last:pb-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-lightbulb mt-0.5 h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-caution\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 14c.2-1 .7-1.7 1.5-2.5 1-.9 1.5-2.2 1.5-3.5A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 1 .2 2.2 1.5 3.5.7.7 1.3 1.5 1.5 2.5\"></path><path d=\"M9 18h6\"></path><path d=\"M10 22h4\"></path></svg><div class=\"min-w-0\"><p class=\"font-medium\">Save discounts for slow hours</p><p class=\"mt-0.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted\">Your 10% discount costs ₹33.38 on every order. Running it only at off-peak times protects peak-hour profit.</p></div></li><li class=\"flex gap-3 py-3 first:pt-0 last:pb-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-lightbulb mt-0.5 h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-muted\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 14c.2-1 .7-1.7 1.5-2.5 1-.9 1.5-2.2 1.5-3.5A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 1 .2 2.2 1.5 3.5.7.7 1.3 1.5 1.5 2.5\"></path><path d=\"M9 18h6\"></path><path d=\"M10 22h4\"></path></svg><div class=\"min-w-0\"><p class=\"font-medium\">Commission + GST is your biggest deduction</p><p class=\"mt-0.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted\">₹88.61 per order. Each 1 point of commission costs ₹3.54 per order including GST.</p></div></li><li class=\"flex gap-3 py-3 first:pt-0 last:pb-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-lightbulb mt-0.5 h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-muted\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 14c.2-1 .7-1.7 1.5-2.5 1-.9 1.5-2.2 1.5-3.5A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 1 .2 2.2 1.5 3.5.7.7 1.3 1.5 1.5 2.5\"></path><path d=\"M9 18h6\"></path><path d=\"M10 22h4\"></path></svg><div class=\"min-w-0\"><p class=\"font-medium\">Check ads against the orders they bring</p><p class=\"mt-0.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted\">Ads take ₹15.02 per order. Keep the ad types that bring profitable orders and cut the rest.</p></div></li></ul><p class=\"mt-4 text-xs text-muted-light\">Estimates based on the numbers you entered. Not a guarantee of results.</p></section><section aria-labelledby=\"formula-title\" class=\"print-break rounded-2xl border border-line bg-inverse p-6 text-on-inverse sm:p-8\"><p class=\"eyebrow text-accent-bright\">Formula</p><h2 id=\"formula-title\" class=\"mt-1 text-xl font-semibold text-on-inverse\">How the numbers are calculated</h2><dl class=\"mt-5 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-on-inverse/5 p-4\"><dt class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-on-inverse/60\">Discount</dt><dd class=\"mt-1.5 font-mono text-sm leading-relaxed text-on-inverse\">Selling price × Discount %</dd></div><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-on-inverse/5 p-4\"><dt class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-on-inverse/60\">Commissionable value (CV)</dt><dd class=\"mt-1.5 font-mono text-sm leading-relaxed text-on-inverse\">Selling price − Discount + Packaging charge</dd></div><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-on-inverse/5 p-4\"><dt class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-on-inverse/60\">Commission</dt><dd class=\"mt-1.5 font-mono text-sm leading-relaxed text-on-inverse\">CV × Commission %</dd></div><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-on-inverse/5 p-4\"><dt class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-on-inverse/60\">GST on commission</dt><dd class=\"mt-1.5 font-mono text-sm leading-relaxed text-on-inverse\">Commission × 18%</dd></div><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-on-inverse/5 p-4\"><dt class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-on-inverse/60\">Ads</dt><dd class=\"mt-1.5 font-mono text-sm leading-relaxed text-on-inverse\">CV × Ads %</dd></div><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-on-inverse/5 p-4\"><dt class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-on-inverse/60\">Payout</dt><dd class=\"mt-1.5 font-mono text-sm leading-relaxed text-on-inverse\">CV − Commission − GST on commission − Ads</dd></div><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-on-inverse/5 p-4\"><dt class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-on-inverse/60\">Profit</dt><dd class=\"mt-1.5 font-mono text-sm leading-relaxed text-on-inverse\">Payout − (Dish cost + Labour + Packaging cost)</dd></div><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-on-inverse/5 p-4\"><dt class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-on-inverse/60\">Profit % / Payout %</dt><dd class=\"mt-1.5 font-mono text-sm leading-relaxed text-on-inverse\">Profit ÷ Selling price × 100 / Payout ÷ Selling price × 100</dd></div></dl></section><section aria-labelledby=\"learn-title\" class=\"print-break\"><p class=\"eyebrow text-accent-dark\">Learn</p><h2 id=\"learn-title\" class=\"mt-1 text-2xl font-semibold\">Understanding <!-- -->online payout</h2><div class=\"mt-6 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-3\"><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-card p-5\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold\">What is this?</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\">A breakdown of one delivery-app order from the price on the menu to the profit you keep.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-card p-5\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold\">How it works</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\">The discount comes off the selling price first; any packaging charge is added to give the commissionable value. Commission and 18% GST on it come off that, then ads as a share of it. What&#x27;s left is the payout; subtract your costs for profit. GST the customer pays on food isn&#x27;t included, because the platform collects and pays it and you never receive it.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-card p-5\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold\">Why it matters</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\">Many owners judge delivery by the payout. The payout isn&#x27;t profit: the food, labour and packaging still have to be paid for. This view shows whether each order really makes money.</p></div></div><div class=\"mt-5 rounded-2xl border border-line bg-accent-soft/60 p-5\"><h3 class=\"flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-book-open h-4 w-4 text-accent-dark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 7v14\"></path><path d=\"M3 18a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 4 4 0 0 1 4-4h5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6a3 3 0 0 0-3 3 3 3 0 0 0-3-3z\"></path></svg> Worked example</h3><p class=\"tabular mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\">₹333.76 selling price, 10% discount, 25% commission, 5% ads: discount ₹33.38, CV ₹300.38, commission ₹75.10, GST on commission ₹13.52, ads ₹15.02. Payout ₹196.75. Profit ₹196.75 − ₹130 = ₹66.75 (20%), matching the Menu Pricing example.</p></div><div class=\"mt-5 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-card p-5\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold\">Common mistakes</h3><ul class=\"mt-3 grid gap-2.5\"><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-triangle-alert mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-caution\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg>Treating the payout as profit.</li><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-triangle-alert mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-caution\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg>Mixing up your packaging cost with the packaging charge to the customer.</li><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-triangle-alert mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-caution\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg>Running the same discount at peak hours as at slow hours.</li></ul></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-card p-5\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold\">Ways to improve</h3><ul class=\"mt-3 grid gap-2.5\"><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-sage\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg>Use the Menu Pricing calculator to set prices that cover every deduction.</li><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-sage\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg>Negotiate commission once your volume gives you leverage.</li><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-sage\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg>Keep only the ad types that bring profitable orders.</li></ul></div></div><p class=\"mt-4 text-xs text-muted\">Reference ranges are indicative, drawn from common industry practice. The right numbers for your outlet depend on format, city, cuisine and pricing.</p></section><section aria-labelledby=\"faq-title\" class=\"no-print\"><h2 id=\"faq-title\" class=\"text-2xl font-semibold\">Frequently asked questions</h2><div class=\"mt-5 divide-y divide-line rounded-2xl border border-line bg-card\"><details class=\"group px-5 [&amp;_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden\"><summary class=\"flex min-h-[56px] cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-4 font-medium\">What is the commissionable value?<span class=\"grid h-7 w-7 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-wash text-muted transition-transform group-open:rotate-45\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></summary><p class=\"pb-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\">Selling price minus discount plus any packaging charge. The platform&#x27;s commission is worked out on this amount.</p></details><details class=\"group px-5 [&amp;_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden\"><summary class=\"flex min-h-[56px] cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-4 font-medium\">Why isn&#x27;t the customer&#x27;s GST on food included?<span class=\"grid h-7 w-7 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-wash text-muted transition-transform group-open:rotate-45\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></summary><p class=\"pb-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\">The platform collects the GST on food from the customer and pays it to the government itself, so the restaurant never receives it. It doesn&#x27;t affect your payout or profit.</p></details><details class=\"group px-5 [&amp;_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden\"><summary class=\"flex min-h-[56px] cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-4 font-medium\">Why is my profit different from my payout?<span class=\"grid h-7 w-7 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-wash text-muted transition-transform group-open:rotate-45\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></summary><p class=\"pb-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\">Payout is what the platform sends you. Profit is what&#x27;s left after you also pay for the dish, labour and packaging.</p></details></div><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is the commissionable value?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Selling price minus discount plus any packaging charge. The platform's commission is worked out on this amount.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Why isn't the customer's GST on food included?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The platform collects the GST on food from the customer and pays it to the government itself, so the restaurant never receives it. It doesn't affect your payout or profit.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Why is my profit different from my payout?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Payout is what the platform sends you. Profit is what's left after you also pay for the dish, labour and packaging.\"}}]}</script></section><section aria-labelledby=\"related-title\" class=\"no-print\"><h2 id=\"related-title\" class=\"text-2xl font-semibold\">Related calculators</h2><div class=\"mt-5 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\"><a class=\"group relative flex h-full flex-col gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-line bg-card p-5 shadow-card transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-line-strong hover:shadow-lift\" href=\"/restaurant/menu-pricing-calculator\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-3\"><span class=\"grid h-11 w-11 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-accent-soft text-accent-dark transition-colors group-hover:bg-accent group-hover:text-accent-ink\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-tag h-5 w-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12.586 2.586A2 2 0 0 0 11.172 2H4a2 2 0 0 